Z||000001||KRMFiero||09-30-2001||07:55 PM||||How did you make those door pods? or did you buy them? what size speakers are in there? how much room?<P>Kyle||||reg||1
Z||000002||AutoXdbdragSE||09-30-2001||07:59 PM||||i hand built the door pods, out of a wood laminate, and then covered them in bondo, paint, the top speaker is a 6.5" R-F fanatic p, the bottom is an 8" sub.. they are two chamber, and i cut a 5x6 hole in the door to mount the 8, with the door closed the 8 is in between the edge of the seat and the door, drivers side space is no problem.. on passenger side, it is a little cramped, but i've ridden in it on a 3 hour ride with my dad before, so it's not bad..<p>[This message has been edited by AutoXdbdragSE (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||1
